      "audioUrl": "audio/unicorn_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "I've never seen an 18-year-old look so serious.",
      "duration": 3.171
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Apollo",
      "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "Most 18-year-olds aren't about to summon an Elder God.",
      "duration": 3.206
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Celeste",
      "audioFile": "unicorn_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/unicorn_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "That's fair, but I bet you'd look the same if you were at the circus.",
      "duration": 4.117
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Apollo",
      "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "I'd never waste my time going to the circus.",
      "duration": 2.431
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Celeste",
      "audioFile": "unicorn_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/unicorn_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_05.mp3",
      "text": "You're missing out on life.",
      "duration": 1.702
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "character": "Apollo",
      "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_06",
      "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_unicorn_fencer_convo03_06.mp3",
      "text": "No, I'm setting myself up to enjoy it.",
      "duration": 2.98
    }
  ]
